# FizzBuzz (MASTER_DOCUMENT.md §20.3)

repeat 15 as i
    if i % 15 is 0
        say "FizzBuzz"
    else
        if i % 3 is 0
            say "Fizz"
        else
            if i % 5 is 0
                say "Buzz"
            else
                say i
            end if
        end if
    end if
end repeat
